<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: biomutation lance -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.label>lance de biomutação</Apparel_BiomutationLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It twists and reshapes the musculature of the target, causing them to transform into a terrifying creature.\n\nThis biomutation lance was crafted from a broken shard of dark archotechnology. -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Torce e remodela a musculatura do alvo, fazendo com que eles se transformem em uma criatura aterrorizante.\n\nEsta lança de biomutação foi trabalhada a partir de um fragmento quebrado de arqueologia escura.</Apparel_BiomutationLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_BiomutationLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em cooldown</Apparel_BiomutationLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: biomutation lance -->
  <Apparel_BiomutationLance.verbs.biomutation_lance.label>lance de biomutação</Apparel_BiomutationLance.verbs.biomutation_lance.label>
  <!-- EN: shard insanity lance -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.label>lance de insanidade dura</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It overwhelms the target's mind with terrifying perceptual distortions, driving them into a berserk state. There is a risk of brain damage.\n\nThis insanity lance was crafted from a broken shard of dark archotechnology. It has a shorter range than its non-shard based counterpart and it requires line of sight. -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Ela sobrecarrega a mente do alvo com terríveis distorções perceptuais, conduzindo-os para um estado berserk. Há um risco de danos cerebrais.\n\nEsta lança de insanidade foi trabalhada a partir de um fragmento quebrado de arqueologia escura. Tem uma gama mais curta do que a sua contraparte não dura e requer linha de visão.</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em cooldown</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: shard insanity lance -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.label>lance de insanidade dura</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.label>
  <!-- EN: psychic insanity immune -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>insanidade psíquica imune</Apparel_ShardPsychicInsanityLance.verbs.shard_insanity_lance.invalidTargetPawn>
  <!-- EN: shard shock lance -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.label>lança de choque</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A limited-use psychic effector. It shocks the target's mind with chaotic images, blocking coherent perception and dropping them into a state of psychic shock. There is a risk of brain damage.\n\nThis shock lance was crafted from a broken shard of dark archotechnology. It has a shorter range than its non-shard based counterpart and it requires line of sight. -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.description>Um efetor psíquico de uso limitado. Ele choca a mente do alvo com imagens caóticas, bloqueando a percepção coerente e deixá-los em um estado de choque psíquico. Há um risco de danos cerebrais.\n\nEsta lança de choque foi trabalhada a partir de um fragmento quebrado de arqueologia escura. Tem uma gama mais curta do que a sua contraparte não dura e requer linha de visão.</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>carga</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>em cooldown</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: shard shock lance -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.label>lança de choque</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.label>
  <!-- EN: psychic shock immune -->
  <Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>choque psíquico imunológico</Apparel_ShardPsychicShockLance.verbs.shard_shock_lance.invalidTargetPawn>
